<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after paragraph (d) the following paragraph: “(e) the drawback claimed in respect of any one consignment of exported goods is not less than two hundred ringgit.”. Amendment of section 19a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/20/eng@> .
