<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/20/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/20/eng@> .
